----------------------------------------
Name: Aniah
MATHS: 92
ENGLISH: 85
SCIENCE: 88
Average: 88.33
Class: Gradebook
The Gradebook class manages all student objects.

Attributes
Attribute	Description
students	List containing Student objects

Methods
add_student(student)
Adds a student object to the gradebook.

Example:

gradebook.add_student(student)
remove_student(student_name)
Removes a student from the gradebook.

Example:

